WEBVTT

00:00:08.465 --> 00:00:09.466
[thud]

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:11.176
We defeated Orson that day.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.346
But at great cost.

00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:21.604
To keep the Lost World safe,
we banished Orson

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.606
-to a place called Lava Island.
-[clatters]

00:00:24.106 --> 00:00:26.483
-[Orson screams]
-And not the nice one.

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:30.029
We thought a little alone time
would help Orson

00:00:30.112 --> 00:00:31.572
to have a change of heart,

00:00:31.655 --> 00:00:33.741
but his heart hardened even more

00:00:33.824 --> 00:00:35.034
and he became obsessed

00:00:35.117 --> 00:00:36.577
-with getting revenge.
-[raptors growl]

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.746
-We didn't know he'd have company.
-[both snarl]

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.539
-[gasps]
-[inhales]

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.251
We're not sure how he survived

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:46.212
-or what happened next.
-[raptors roar]

00:00:46.295 --> 00:00:47.379
[yelps]

00:00:48.005 --> 00:00:49.131
[gasps]

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.759
-[growl]
-[yells]

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:54.345
[yells]

00:00:54.428 --> 00:00:55.846
[hisses]

00:00:57.264 --> 00:00:59.183
[growls] Ooh.

00:01:01.393 --> 00:01:04.355
[childish voice] Ooh. You likey the fire?

00:01:04.855 --> 00:01:08.609
[Buck] All we know is that Orson
somehow escaped from Lava Island

00:01:08.692 --> 00:01:11.111
with a couple of raptors
under his command.

00:01:12.196 --> 00:01:13.864
[fire hisses]

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.282
[panting]

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.117
Sit.

00:01:17.201 --> 00:01:18.494
[soft thuds]

00:01:18.577 --> 00:01:19.912
Stand.

00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:22.039
[soft growl]

00:01:22.122 --> 00:01:24.959
Bow to me. [evil laughs]

00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:27.586
[both low growl]

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:34.134
Ah, simpletons. All it takes
is a little fire to bend you to my will.

00:01:34.718 --> 00:01:38.013
The Lost World will finally be mine.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.057
[both growl]

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.268
[Buck] And he was free.

00:01:42.893 --> 00:01:44.270
[both] Ooh.

00:01:44.353 --> 00:01:45.479
And then what happened?

00:01:46.814 --> 00:01:49.525
Then you two showed up
and nearly got yourselves killed.

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:51.610
[Eddie] Yay, we're in the story!

00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:53.153
[leaves rustle]

00:01:53.862 --> 00:01:55.906
[sniffs, growls]

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:56.991
[rustling]

00:01:57.074 --> 00:01:59.243
[Buck] Okay, boys. Lights out.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:03.539
[Crash] Buck, can you tell us more
about the superhero team?

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:04.748
[sniffs, growls]

00:02:04.832 --> 00:02:07.793
[Buck] Uh, nah.
That's a tale for another night.

00:02:08.544 --> 00:02:09.753
[skittering]

00:02:09.837 --> 00:02:11.046
Whoa, whoa!

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.214
-Shh!
-[yelps]

00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:17.761
[grunts]

00:02:18.345 --> 00:02:20.055
-[knife clinks]
-[raptor roars]

00:02:22.516 --> 00:02:23.809
[grunts, sniffs]

00:02:23.893 --> 00:02:25.311
[sniffs, growls]

00:02:26.103 --> 00:02:27.313
[rattles]

00:02:28.439 --> 00:02:29.732
[low growling]

00:02:29.815 --> 00:02:31.275
-[thuds, clatters]
-[both snarl]

00:02:31.358 --> 00:02:33.152
[both roar]

00:02:36.363 --> 00:02:37.781
[growling]

00:02:40.117 --> 00:02:41.118
[thud]

00:02:42.578 --> 00:02:44.705
-[clattering, clang]
-[hiss, growl]

00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:48.918
-[growling]
-[imitates roar]

00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:53.505
[roaring]

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:56.217
Shh!

00:03:01.889 --> 00:03:03.349
[vocalizes]

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.185
[vocalizes]

00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:09.104
[vocalizes]

00:03:11.523 --> 00:03:12.900
-[vocalizes]
-[raptors hiss]

00:03:13.567 --> 00:03:15.152
[growls, roars]

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:26.789
[raptor roars]

00:03:26.872 --> 00:03:29.166
[growl]

00:03:31.293 --> 00:03:33.504
[objects crash, clatter]

00:03:35.297 --> 00:03:37.424
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:03:37.508 --> 00:03:38.926
[squeal, growl]

00:03:39.009 --> 00:03:40.511
[roars]

00:03:40.594 --> 00:03:41.762
[shrieks]

00:03:41.845 --> 00:03:43.973
-[both roar]
-[spraying]

00:03:45.724 --> 00:03:47.726
[both squeal]

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:50.229
[sniffs]

00:03:50.312 --> 00:03:51.605
What's that smell?

00:03:51.689 --> 00:03:54.525
[sniffs] Oh, yeah. Gas.

00:03:54.608 --> 00:03:55.651
[both] Yours?

00:03:56.527 --> 00:03:58.612
[echoing] Zee.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.200
[ringing]

00:04:07.037 --> 00:04:08.414
[Crash, distorted] Buck.

00:04:08.956 --> 00:04:10.207
[Eddie, distorted] Buck?

00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:11.458
-Buck?
-[thud]

00:04:11.542 --> 00:04:13.252
-[groans]
-Buck?

00:04:13.335 --> 00:04:14.670
[evil laughs]

00:04:14.753 --> 00:04:17.131
[yells] The possums! The possums!

00:04:17.214 --> 00:04:19.216
Gas don't faze us, dude.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.843
We're used to things that stink.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:22.720
[sighs]

00:04:22.803 --> 00:04:23.929
[gasps]

00:04:24.555 --> 00:04:26.348
[Zee] Looking for this?

00:04:35.983 --> 00:04:37.401
Wow.

00:04:37.484 --> 00:04:39.737
Zee, is that you?

00:04:40.237 --> 00:04:42.364
Well, someone had to save your butt.

00:04:43.032 --> 00:04:44.533
[squeals, grunts]

00:04:46.577 --> 00:04:47.703
So I picked me.

00:04:47.786 --> 00:04:49.538
Wait. What about Bronwyn?

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.874
She's safe. I left her with the cucumber.

00:04:51.957 --> 00:04:54.585
Good. The cucumber knows karate.

00:04:55.169 --> 00:04:58.797
Dude. Psst. You know Bronwyn's, like,
a pumpkin, right?

00:04:58.881 --> 00:05:01.926
Yeah. I also know Buck's got a cousin
who's a pine cone.

00:05:02.009 --> 00:05:03.427
Oh, right. Philip.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:06.138
Buck, who's your awesome skunk friend?

00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:09.266
I'm not a skunk, guys. I'm a zorilla.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.809
What's the difference?

00:05:11.393 --> 00:05:14.438
The difference is
[shouting] I'm a mammal on a mission

00:05:14.939 --> 00:05:17.900
to bring equality
and justice to the Lost World.

00:05:18.734 --> 00:05:21.153
[normal voice]
Also, skunks have slightly shorter tails.

00:05:21.237 --> 00:05:22.655
She's totally a skunk.

00:05:22.738 --> 00:05:25.366
A skunk with a secret identity!

00:05:25.449 --> 00:05:27.076
Cool.

00:05:27.159 --> 00:05:29.620
Well-- I-- Okay, yeah.

00:05:29.703 --> 00:05:32.748
-If that'll get you going, great.
-[dinosaurs roar]

00:05:32.831 --> 00:05:34.833
Come on, those boneheads are waking up.

00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.377
[Eddie] We'll follow you anywhere.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.255
[Crash] Off a cliff, underwater,
into a volcano.

00:05:42.299 --> 00:05:43.759
I like your new friends.

00:05:43.842 --> 00:05:45.469
-[yelps]
-[laughs]

00:05:45.553 --> 00:05:46.971
They make me feel smart.

00:05:47.054 --> 00:05:48.806
Don't worry.
What they lack in intelligence,

00:05:48.889 --> 00:05:51.308
they make up for in bumbling ineptitude.

00:05:52.601 --> 00:05:55.020
Buck, we have some unfinished business
to take care of.

00:05:55.104 --> 00:05:59.275
[scoffs] I mean, you know. Look. I know
we didn't always see eye to eye.

00:05:59.358 --> 00:06:01.819
Or, in my case, eyes to eye.

00:06:01.902 --> 00:06:07.074
Relax. I'm only here for one reason,
and it's bigger than you and me.

00:06:07.908 --> 00:06:13.038
If we don't stop Orson, he'll destroy
the harmony we fought so hard for.

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:16.750
With him in charge,
the Lost World will be, well…

00:06:17.918 --> 00:06:19.336
lost.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.796
Oh.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.506
Right.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.010
And because then it will be
the "Lost Lost World,"

00:06:26.093 --> 00:06:28.220
which is both sad and confusing.

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:30.931
[as Lefty]
Is the team getting back together again?

00:06:31.015 --> 00:06:32.349
You stay out of it, you!

00:06:32.433 --> 00:06:34.101
I thought you two stopped talking.

00:06:34.184 --> 00:06:35.811
[as Lefty] We patched things up.

00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:38.856
And no, Lefty.
The team's not getting back together.

00:06:39.356 --> 00:06:41.734
Once we stop Orson, I'm outta here.

00:06:41.817 --> 00:06:43.485
That's a secret skunk for ya.

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.696
They never stay in one place too long.

00:06:45.779 --> 00:06:47.907
[Eddie]
Of course that glorious scent lingers.

00:06:51.493 --> 00:06:52.828
[clattering]

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:02.630
Hmm. No, no, no. My head's not that big.
This is not to scale at all.

00:07:02.713 --> 00:07:03.714
[imitating Orson]

00:07:03.797 --> 00:07:06.133
-I know you're there.
-[imitating Orson] I know you're there.

00:07:06.217 --> 00:07:08.594
-What have I said about copying, huh?
-[continues imitating]

00:07:08.677 --> 00:07:11.889
Uh-uh-uh. Don't-- Don't--
Don't you-- Don't you dare.

00:07:12.389 --> 00:07:14.975
-Stop copying me!
-[crash, clattering]

00:07:15.059 --> 00:07:16.185
[growls]

00:07:17.019 --> 00:07:19.647
-Oh, I should have worked with birds.
-[grunts, vocalizes]

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.023
Huh?

